  "summary": "global/country-currency-selector — PWA Component",
  "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/19294",
  "description": "As a Developer, \nI want a reusable `global/country-currency-selector` React component built to the Zimmermann Design System 2026 spec, \nso that it can be consumed across storefronts to allow shoppers to select their shipping country, currency, and optionally language.\n\n----\n\nThe component is a right-anchored slide-in drawer. It accepts props to control which optional sections render. It does not own redirect logic — that will be covered in [SFCC-688](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-688) or [SFCC-817](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-817)",
