{"result":"{
  "id": "19314",
  "key": "SFCC-817",
  "summary": "Regional Storefronts — IP Geolocation Routing & AU Storefront Gating",
  "description": "As a Shopper, \n\nI want to be automatically directed to the correct Zimmermann regional storefront for my location when I first visit the site, \n\nso that I see the right pricing, currency, language, and shipping options for where I am.\n\n----\n\nIP geolocation routing applies to all storefronts on first visit. The AU storefront (ZimmermannAU) is additionally gated: only visitors with IP addresses mapping to Oceania region countries (per the Country List per Storefront) may access it. All other IPs are blocked from AU and routed to their correct storefront. Country-to-storefront mapping is defined in the Country List per Storefront: [https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/255852545](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/255852545)",
